  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.1",
  "name": "HumanEgo",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tHumanEgo\n\t\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n  HumanEgo: Zero-Shot Robot Learning from Minutes of Human Egocentric Videos\n  \ud83c\udf10 Website &nbsp;\u00b7&nbsp;\n  \ud83d\udcc4 Paper &nbsp;\u00b7&nbsp;\n  \ud83d\udcbb Code &nbsp;\u00b7&nbsp;\n  \ud83c\udfa5 Visualization Gallery\n\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tDataset Summary\n\t\n\nHumanEgo is a dataset of human egocentric manipulation videos recorded with\nProject Aria (Gen 1) glasses, paired with Meta MPS annotations (SLAM trajectories +\nhand tracking) and the full HumanEgo preprocessing output \u2014 per-frame RGB, object/arm\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/Leo-TX/HumanEgo.",
